"A list a call makes, found by itself, is at a region of its own, as
 FX-26's is: not acyclic, which a later use would have it be.
 Fixpt accepts it since e4af8997 (a list nothing places is `acyclic`,
 TODO 4b); kayak's checker keeps its region its own until it takes that
 rule."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) spin))
(define h (poly ((a type)) (subr pure ((listof a acyclic)) i64)) (lambda (fs) 0))
(h (cons "x" nil))
